<h3><u>Zinda rahey hussain</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>zinda rahe hussain tera gham manaayenge<br />
ay fatema ke laal ye waada nibhaayenge</p>

<p>ghar me hamaare aayengi majlis me fatema<br />
farshe aza ke saath ye dil bhi bichaayenge</p>

<p>jhule amaariyan ye shabihein ye taaziye<br />
tehzeebe gham se dard ke manzar sajaayenge</p>

<p>ye unka hai julus jo pyaase huwe shaheed<br />
ham iske raaste me sabilein lagaayenge</p>

<p>kehte hain chote chote se bachhe ye baap se<br />
ek roz baba jaan ye alam ham uthaayenge</p>

<p>kuch der zuljanah mere ghar pe rok do<br />
pyaase ki is sawaari ko paani pilaayenge</p>

<p>bachpan se hai dua ke banaayenge ghar jahaan<br />
ashur khaana ghar me wahaan ham sajaayenge</p>

<p>ghar me agar ho nazre sakina to hai yaqeen<br />
us nazr me sakina ke ammu bhi aaayenge</p>

<p>kis shaan ke mile hain namaazi hussain ko<br />
teeron ke saamne ye musalle bichaayenge</p>

<p>bachhon ko apne sajda e shabbir ki qasam<br />
maatam ke saath saath namazein sikhaayenge</p>

<p>raahe hussainiyat ke shaheedon salaam lo<br />
inko na apne dil se kabhi ham bhulaayenge</p>

<p>baade zahoor hoga moharram ka ye hasham<br />
ham karbala imam ke hamraah jaayenge</p>

<p>nauha bhi hai safeer e aza sarwar o hilal<br />
jis des me bhi jaayenge nauha sunaayenge</p>
</p>